    "description": "The Telecom SIM Deactivation API facilitates the bulk deactivation of telecom SIM cards. It enables businesses to manage their SIM inventory efficiently by allowing multiple SIMs to be deactivated in a single request. Common use cases include service termination, account management, and fraud prevention. This API is designed for telecom operators and service management platforms looking to streamline their SIM handling operations.",
